{
  "_comment": [
    "Expectations for `junit-metrics.ts` over the candidate CI runs (Phase 9).",
    "Identical to `../baseline/expectations.json` except that the timeout floors",
    "are ENFORCED: a timeout-shaped test that overruns its bound is a violation,",
    "not a printed remark. Invoke with the baseline run as the reference so the",
    "matched-test comparison runs inside each environment:",
    "  npx tsx ../junit-metrics.ts candidate/<run-id> --label 'candidate <run-id>' \\",
    "    --expect candidate/expectations.json \\",
    "    --baseline baseline/<run-id> --baseline-expect baseline/expectations.json"
  ],
  "environments": ["ubuntu-latest", "macos-latest", "windows-latest", "wsl2-ubuntu"],
  "cells": [
    { "tier": "L1", "package": "claudine-cli" }
